# Allocators

Zig has *no* default allocator. Pass one in, as `std.mem.Allocator`.

## Arena

An arena frees everything at once:

```zig
var arena = std.heap.ArenaAllocator.init(gpa);
defer arena.deinit();
const a = arena.allocator();
```

See [ArenaAllocator](https://example.com/docs/std/heap.html#ArenaAllocator) and [the site](https://ziglang.org/).
